# Search-tool ignore (ripgrep respects this; GIT DOES NOT -- files here
# stay tracked and committed). Purpose: keep enormous single-line
# machine-generated files from flooding code-search results.
#
# horcrux/*.svg -- vant stego horcruxes are one 800 KB+ line of base64
# ciphertext; any repo-wide match echoes the whole wall and starves the
# result budget (see horcrux/README.md + AGENTS.md). The stone stays
# committed to main; disaster recovery (scripts/cairn_recover.sh) is
# unaffected.
horcrux/*.svg

# bun.lock -- lockfiles are churned by tooling, never edited by hand;
# noise for search, still tracked for reproducible installs.
bun.lock
